hits.text:
Think OpenRouter, but it pays you back.

@XavaInference just launched. Same idea, one key for every major model. But there’s no fee on USDC top-ups, where OpenRouter takes 5% on crypto, and every prompt sends some cash back your way in $INFX

The part I like: point any OpenAI-compatible tool or agent at it, change two lines, and you’re running.

